171
00:11:03,774 --> 00:11:04,214
Build.

172
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:08,606
Our CI system sees that only payment
changed, so it does not compile a

173
00:11:08,610 --> 00:11:11,421
loyalty or IoT or account module.

174
00:11:11,848 --> 00:11:15,852
It only compiles a payment against a
